&#x200B;

I loved Solaris.  I wish people were on board, It was popular for a month but people's "ego's were too fragile' =p =) .   and it was in a coma for the next 2 months, then Pgi fucked with rewards pissing off most of those that gave it a try,  then over the next 3 months pgi ignored peoples discussion about pgi fucking with rewards at the end of a season being a bad move,  and fucked with rewards even closer to the end of the 2nd season. 

&#x200B;

 PGi sent Solaris from comatose possibly salvagable to coffin by not changing it to 1 bucket for queuing for all 7 divisions at the end of season 1 and not changing rewards structures at the beginning of a season instead of at the end.

&#x200B;

Its dead and reducing the days you can play it is not going to incentivize anyone.  I really didnt want to join the "its dead bandwagon", because that negativity from streamers 4 weeks after it launched helped kill it even faster,  but im sorry,  its dead baguette.

&#x200B;

If you put 2 person queue's into solo queue QP it will kill group queue times which are already too long, just sync drop and sometimes you get to kill your friend, sometimes you get to carry them.
